      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_Kalskag%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Yupiit Piciryarait Cultural Center in Lower Kalskag showcases the history and culture of the Yup'ik people.",
